      "kind": "negative",
      "title": "JSON 溢出数值窗口不得崩溃",
      "operation": "k06_groups",
      "derivation": "Q NEW-P1-1：JSON 1e400 经 json.loads 得到 inf，int(inf) 曾抛 OverflowError 使整份报告构建失败。窗口必须是有限 int64 毫秒；非有限/超界 → FAIL + WINDOW_INVALID 阻断项（fail-closed 且结构化）。",
      "inputs": {
